  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Aid</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure the survival of the most vulnerable people affected by the conflict through multi-sectoral emergency aid and to make them more resilient to further external shocks. For newly internally displaced people, WHH will provide emergency food security, WASH and Shelter/NFI sectors. In addition, people who have already arrived will receive agricultural vouchers to make them less dependent on acute emergency aid and thus reduce negative coping strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
